! Proposed Definitions And Examples

!! Proposed Definition of ''lu''

;__lu__ (LU): quote -- start grammatical quotation; quoted text should be grammatical on its own --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''lu'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''lo'u''

;__lo'u__ (LOhU): error quote -- start questionable/out-of-context quote; text should be Lojban words, but needn't be grammatical --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''lo'u'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''le'u''

;__le'u__ (LEhU): end error quote -- end quote of questionable or out-of-context text; not elidable --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''le'u'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''li'u''

;__li'u__ (LIhU): end quote -- elidable terminator: end grammatical quotation; seldom elidable except at end of text --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''li'u'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''zo''

;__zo__ (ZO): 1-word quote -- quote next word only; quotes a single Lojban word (not a cmavo compound or tanru) --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''zo'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''la'o''

;__la'o__ (ZOI): the non-Lojban named -- delimited non-Lojban name; the resulting quote sumti is treated as a name --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''la'o'' Usage
!! Proposed Definition of ''zoi''

;__zoi__ (ZOI): non-Lojban quote -- delimited non-Lojban quotation; the result treated as a block of text --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''zoi'' Usage

